: Stage 1 integer bounds, StageL-internal Euclidean modulus, and non-trapping overflow/division predicates.
ns std/math.
use std/u128:
    u128Val u128Zero as u128ConstZero u128Max as u128ConstMax
    eq as u128Eq ne as u128Ne lt as u128Lt le as u128Le gt as u128Gt ge as u128Ge
    wrapSum as u128WrapAdd wrapDiff as u128WrapSub wrapProd as u128WrapMul
    canAdd as u128CanAdd canSub as u128CanSub canMul as u128CanMul canDiv as u128CanDiv
    bitAnd as u128BitAnd bitOr as u128BitOr bitXor as u128BitXor bitNot as u128BitNot
    rotl as u128Rotl rotr as u128Rotr clz as u128Clz ctz as u128Ctz popcnt as u128Popcnt
    tryAdd as u128TryAdd trySub as u128TrySub tryMul as u128TryMul
    tryDiv as u128TryDiv tryMod as u128TryMod tryShl as u128TryShl tryShr as u128TryShr
::.
use std/i128:
    i128Val i128Zero i128Min as i128ConstMin i128Max as i128ConstMax
    eq as i128Eq ne as i128Ne lt as i128Lt le as i128Le gt as i128Gt ge as i128Ge
    wrapSum as i128WrapAdd wrapDiff as i128WrapSub wrapProd as i128WrapMul wrapNeg as i128WrapNeg
    canAdd as i128CanAdd canSub as i128CanSub canMul as i128CanMul canDiv as i128CanDiv canNeg as i128CanNeg
    bitAnd as i128BitAnd bitOr as i128BitOr bitXor as i128BitXor bitNot as i128BitNot
    clz as i128Clz ctz as i128Ctz popcnt as i128Popcnt
    tryNeg as i128TryNeg tryAdd as i128TryAdd trySub as i128TrySub tryMul as i128TryMul
    tryDiv as i128TryDiv tryTruncRem as i128TryTruncRem tryMod as i128TryMod
    tryShl as i128TryShl tryShr as i128TryShr
::.
use std/bigint:
    bigInt
    eq as bigIntEq ne as bigIntNe lt as bigIntLt le as bigIntLe gt as bigIntGt ge as bigIntGe
    neg as bigIntNeg sum as bigIntAdd diff as bigIntSub prod as bigIntMul
    canAdd as bigIntCanAdd canSub as bigIntCanSub canMul as bigIntCanMul canDiv as bigIntCanDiv canNeg as bigIntCanNeg
    tryDiv as bigIntTryDiv tryTruncRem as bigIntTryTruncRem tryMod as bigIntTryMod
::.
use std/rat:
    ratVal
    eq as ratEq ne as ratNe lt as ratLt le as ratLe gt as ratGt ge as ratGe
    neg as ratNeg sum as ratAdd diff as ratSub prod as ratMul
    canAdd as ratCanAdd canSub as ratCanSub canMul as ratCanMul canDiv as ratCanDiv canNeg as ratCanNeg
    tryDiv as ratTryDiv
::.

: Minimum unsigned 8-bit integer (0).
: @dc l8589978541
pub u8/u8Min u8:0.

: Maximum unsigned 8-bit integer (255).
: @dc l8589978265
pub u8/u8Max u8:255.

: Unsigned 8-bit StageL-internal Euclidean modulus (`0 <= (modStageLInternal lhs rhs) < rhs`); faults when `rhs == 0`.
: @dc l8589978542
pub v/u8/modStageLInternal u8/lhs u8/rhs
    test
        in u8:7 u8:3
        out u8:1.
        in u8:255 u8:10
        out u8:5.
        in u8:0 u8:5
        out u8:0.
        in u8:1 u8:0
        out fault.
    rem /lhs /rhs.

: Returns true iff checked `add lhs rhs` will not overflow unsigned 8-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978266
pub v/b/canAdd u8/lhs u8/rhs
    test
        in u8:200 u8:55
        out true.
        in u8:200 u8:56
        out false.
        in u8:255 u8:0
        out true.
        in u8:255 u8:1
        out false.
    ge wrapSum /lhs /rhs /lhs.

: Returns true iff checked `sub lhs rhs` will not underflow unsigned 8-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978267
pub v/b/canSub u8/lhs u8/rhs
    test
        in u8:10 u8:10
        out true.
        in u8:10 u8:11
        out false.
        in u8:0 u8:1
        out false.
    ge /lhs /rhs.

: Returns true iff checked `mul lhs rhs` will not overflow unsigned 8-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978268
pub v/b/canMul u8/lhs u8/rhs
    test
        in u8:15 u8:17
        out true.
        in u8:16 u8:16
        out false.
        in u8:255 u8:0
        out true.
        in u8:0 u8:255
        out true.
        in u8:255 u8:1
        out true.
    if eq /rhs u8:0
        true
        eq quot wrapProd /lhs /rhs /rhs /lhs.

: Returns true iff checked `div lhs rhs` and `rem lhs rhs` will not fault (`rhs != 0`).
: @dc l8589978269
pub v/b/canDiv u8/lhs u8/rhs
    test
        in u8:10 u8:2
        out true.
        in u8:10 u8:0
        out false.
        in u8:0 u8:0
        out false.
    ne /rhs u8:0.

: Minimum signed 32-bit integer (-2^31).
: @dc l8589978241
pub i32/i32Min i32:-2147483648.

: Maximum signed 32-bit integer (2^31 - 1).
: @dc l8589978242
pub i32/i32Max i32:2147483647.

: StageL-internal Euclidean modulus satisfying `0 <= (modStageLInternal lhs rhs) < |rhs|` for all `rhs != 0`
: (including `modStageLInternal i32Min -1 == 0` and `modStageLInternal -1 i32Min == i32Max`); faults when `rhs == 0`.
: @dc l8589978243
pub v/i32/modStageLInternal i32/lhs i32/rhs
    test
        in i32:7 i32:3
        out i32:1.
        in i32:-7 i32:3
        out i32:2.
        in i32:7 i32:-3
        out i32:1.
        in i32:-7 i32:-3
        out i32:2.
        in i32:0 i32:5
        out i32:0.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:-1
        out i32:0.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:1
        out i32:0.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:-2147483648
        out i32:0.
        in i32:5 i32:-2147483648
        out i32:5.
        in i32:-1 i32:-2147483648
        out i32:2147483647.
        in i32:1 i32:0
        out fault.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:0
        out fault.
    if eq /rhs i32:0
        fault
        if and eq /lhs /i32Min eq /rhs i32:-1
            i32:0
            do
                be i32/remVal rem /lhs /rhs.
                if ge /remVal i32:0
                    /remVal
                    if gt /rhs i32:0
                        sum /remVal /rhs
                        diff /remVal /rhs.
            ::.

: Returns true iff checked `add lhs rhs` will not overflow signed 32-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978244
pub v/b/canAdd i32/lhs i32/rhs
    test
        in i32:10 i32:20
        out true.
        in i32:2147483647 i32:0
        out true.
        in i32:2147483647 i32:1
        out false.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:0
        out true.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:-1
        out false.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:2147483647
        out true.
    be i32/sumVal wrapSum /lhs /rhs.
    ge bitAnd bitXor /sumVal /lhs bitXor /sumVal /rhs i32:0.

: Returns true iff checked `sub lhs rhs` will not overflow signed 32-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978245
pub v/b/canSub i32/lhs i32/rhs
    test
        in i32:10 i32:20
        out true.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:1
        out false.
        in i32:0 i32:-2147483648
        out false.
        in i32:-1 i32:-2147483648
        out true.
        in i32:2147483647 i32:-1
        out false.
        in i32:2147483647 i32:2147483647
        out true.
    be i32/diffVal wrapDiff /lhs /rhs.
    ge bitAnd bitXor /lhs /rhs bitXor /diffVal /lhs i32:0.

: Returns true iff checked `mul lhs rhs` will not overflow signed 32-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978246
pub v/b/canMul i32/lhs i32/rhs
    test
        in i32:46340 i32:46340
        out true.
        in i32:46341 i32:46341
        out false.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:0
        out true.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:1
        out true.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:-1
        out false.
        in i32:-1 i32:-2147483648
        out false.
        in i32:1073741824 i32:-2
        out true.
        in i32:1073741824 i32:2
        out false.
    be i64/prodVal prod conv /lhs i64 conv /rhs i64.
    and ge /prodVal conv /i32Min i64 le /prodVal conv /i32Max i64.

: Returns true iff checked `div lhs rhs` and `rem lhs rhs` will not fault (`rhs != 0` and `!(lhs == i32Min && rhs == -1)`).
: @dc l8589978247
pub v/b/canDiv i32/lhs i32/rhs
    test
        in i32:10 i32:2
        out true.
        in i32:10 i32:0
        out false.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:-1
        out false.
        in i32:-2147483648 i32:1
        out true.
        in i32:-2147483647 i32:-1
        out true.
    and ne /rhs i32:0 not and eq /lhs /i32Min eq /rhs i32:-1.

: Minimum unsigned 32-bit integer (0).
: @dc l8589978543
pub u32/u32Min u32:0.

: Maximum unsigned 32-bit integer (2^32 - 1).
: @dc l8589978255
pub u32/u32Max u32:4294967295.

: Unsigned 32-bit StageL-internal Euclidean modulus (`0 <= (modStageLInternal lhs rhs) < rhs`); faults when `rhs == 0`.
: @dc l8589978544
pub v/u32/modStageLInternal u32/lhs u32/rhs
    test
        in u32:7 u32:3
        out u32:1.
        in u32:4294967295 u32:10
        out u32:5.
        in u32:0 u32:5
        out u32:0.
        in u32:1 u32:0
        out fault.
    rem /lhs /rhs.

: Returns true iff checked `add lhs rhs` will not overflow unsigned 32-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978256
pub v/b/canAdd u32/lhs u32/rhs
    test
        in u32:4294967295 u32:0
        out true.
        in u32:4294967295 u32:1
        out false.
        in u32:2147483648 u32:2147483647
        out true.
        in u32:2147483648 u32:2147483648
        out false.
    ge wrapSum /lhs /rhs /lhs.

: Returns true iff checked `sub lhs rhs` will not underflow unsigned 32-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978257
pub v/b/canSub u32/lhs u32/rhs
    test
        in u32:5 u32:5
        out true.
        in u32:5 u32:6
        out false.
        in u32:0 u32:1
        out false.
    ge /lhs /rhs.

: Returns true iff checked `mul lhs rhs` will not overflow unsigned 32-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978258
pub v/b/canMul u32/lhs u32/rhs
    test
        in u32:65535 u32:65537
        out true.
        in u32:65536 u32:65536
        out false.
        in u32:4294967295 u32:0
        out true.
        in u32:4294967295 u32:1
        out true.
    if eq /rhs u32:0
        true
        eq quot wrapProd /lhs /rhs /rhs /lhs.

: Returns true iff checked `div lhs rhs` and `rem lhs rhs` will not fault (`rhs != 0`).
: @dc l8589978259
pub v/b/canDiv u32/lhs u32/rhs
    test
        in u32:10 u32:2
        out true.
        in u32:10 u32:0
        out false.
        in u32:0 u32:0
        out false.
    ne /rhs u32:0.

: Minimum signed 64-bit integer (-2^63).
: @dc l8589978248
pub i64/i64Min i64:-9223372036854775808.

: Maximum signed 64-bit integer (2^63 - 1).
: @dc l8589978249
pub i64/i64Max i64:9223372036854775807.

: StageL-internal Euclidean modulus satisfying `0 <= (modStageLInternal lhs rhs) < |rhs|` for all `rhs != 0`
: (including `modStageLInternal i64Min -1 == 0` and `modStageLInternal -1 i64Min == i64Max`); faults when `rhs == 0`.
: @dc l8589978250
pub v/i64/modStageLInternal i64/lhs i64/rhs
    test
        in i64:7 i64:3
        out i64:1.
        in i64:-7 i64:3
        out i64:2.
        in i64:7 i64:-3
        out i64:1.
        in i64:-7 i64:-3
        out i64:2.
        in i64:0 i64:5
        out i64:0.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:-1
        out i64:0.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:1
        out i64:0.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out i64:0.
        in i64:5 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out i64:5.
        in i64:-1 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out i64:9223372036854775807.
        in i64:1 i64:0
        out fault.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:0
        out fault.
    if eq /rhs i64:0
        fault
        if and eq /lhs /i64Min eq /rhs i64:-1
            i64:0
            do
                be i64/remVal rem /lhs /rhs.
                if ge /remVal i64:0
                    /remVal
                    if gt /rhs i64:0
                        sum /remVal /rhs
                        diff /remVal /rhs.
            ::.

: Returns true iff checked `add lhs rhs` will not overflow signed 64-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978251
pub v/b/canAdd i64/lhs i64/rhs
    test
        in i64:10 i64:20
        out true.
        in i64:9223372036854775807 i64:0
        out true.
        in i64:9223372036854775807 i64:1
        out false.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:0
        out true.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:-1
        out false.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:9223372036854775807
        out true.
    be i64/sumVal wrapSum /lhs /rhs.
    ge bitAnd bitXor /sumVal /lhs bitXor /sumVal /rhs i64:0.

: Returns true iff checked `sub lhs rhs` will not overflow signed 64-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978252
pub v/b/canSub i64/lhs i64/rhs
    test
        in i64:10 i64:20
        out true.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:1
        out false.
        in i64:0 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out false.
        in i64:-1 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out true.
        in i64:9223372036854775807 i64:-1
        out false.
        in i64:9223372036854775807 i64:9223372036854775807
        out true.
    be i64/diffVal wrapDiff /lhs /rhs.
    ge bitAnd bitXor /lhs /rhs bitXor /diffVal /lhs i64:0.

: Returns true iff checked `mul lhs rhs` will not overflow signed 64-bit bounds.
: @dc l8589978253
pub v/b/canMul i64/lhs i64/rhs
    test
        in i64:3037000499 i64:3037000499
        out true.
        in i64:3037000500 i64:3037000500
        out false.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:0
        out true.
        in i64:0 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out true.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:1
        out true.
        in i64:1 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out true.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:-1
        out false.
        in i64:-1 i64:-9223372036854775808
        out false.
        in i64:4611686018427387904 i64:-2
        out true.
        in i64:4611686018427387904 i64:2
        out false.
    if eq /rhs i64:0
        true
        if eq /rhs i64:-1
            ne /lhs /i64Min
            eq quot wrapProd /lhs /rhs /rhs /lhs.

: Returns true iff checked `div lhs rhs` and `rem lhs rhs` will not fault (`rhs != 0` and `!(lhs == i64Min && rhs == -1)`).
: @dc l8589978254
pub v/b/canDiv i64/lhs i64/rhs
    test
        in i64:10 i64:2
        out true.
        in i64:10 i64:0
        out false.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:-1
        out false.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808 i64:1
        out true.
        in i64:-9223372036854775807 i64:-1
        out true.
    and ne /rhs i64:0 not and eq /lhs /i64Min eq /rhs i64:-1.

