: Minimum unsigned 128-bit integer (`0`).
: @dc l8589984720
pub u128Val/u128Min /u128ConstZero.

: Maximum unsigned 128-bit integer (`2^128 - 1`).
: @dc l8589984721
pub u128Val/u128Max /u128ConstMax.

: Minimum signed 128-bit integer (`-2^127`).
: @dc l8589984722
pub i128Val/i128Min /i128ConstMin.

