: @dc l8589984723
pub i128Val/i128Max /i128ConstMax.

: ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
: Total negation predicates (`canNeg`) and extended `can*` overloads
: ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

: Returns true iff `-a` does not overflow signed 32-bit bounds (`a != i32Min`).
: @dc l8589984724
pub v/b/canNeg i32/a
    test
        in i32:5
        out true.
        in i32:-2147483648
        out false.
    ne /a /i32Min.

: Returns true iff `-a` does not overflow signed 64-bit bounds (`a != i64Min`).
: @dc l8589984725
pub v/b/canNeg i64/a
    test
        in i64:5
        out true.
        in i64:-9223372036854775808
        out false.
    ne /a /i64Min.

: Returns true iff `-a` does not overflow signed 128-bit bounds (`a != i128Min`).
: @dc l8589984726
pub v/b/canNeg i128Val/a
    i128CanNeg /a.

: Returns true iff `-a` succeeds (always `true` for arbitrary-precision `bigInt`).
: @dc l8589984727
pub v/b/canNeg bigInt/a
    bigIntCanNeg /a.

: Returns true iff `-a` succeeds (always `true` for exact `ratVal`).
: @dc l8589984728
pub v/b/canNeg ratVal/a
    ratCanNeg /a.

: Predicate returning true iff signed `a + b` does not overflow `i128Val`.
: @dc l8589984729
pub v/b/canAdd i128Val/a i128Val/b
    i128CanAdd /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff signed `a - b` does not overflow `i128Val`.
: @dc l8589984730
pub v/b/canSub i128Val/a i128Val/b
    i128CanSub /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff signed `a * b` does not overflow `i128Val`.
: @dc l8589984731
pub v/b/canMul i128Val/a i128Val/b
    i128CanMul /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff signed `div a b` succeeds on `i128Val`.
: @dc l8589984732
pub v/b/canDiv i128Val/a i128Val/b
    i128CanDiv /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff `a + b` does not overflow `u128Val`.
: @dc l8589984733
pub v/b/canAdd u128Val/a u128Val/b
    u128CanAdd /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff `a - b` does not underflow `u128Val`.
: @dc l8589984734
pub v/b/canSub u128Val/a u128Val/b
    u128CanSub /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff `a * b` does not overflow `u128Val`.
: @dc l8589984735
pub v/b/canMul u128Val/a u128Val/b
    u128CanMul /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff `div a b` succeeds on `u128Val` (`b != 0`).
: @dc l8589984736
pub v/b/canDiv u128Val/a u128Val/b
    u128CanDiv /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff `a + b` succeeds on `bigInt` (`true`).
: @dc l8589984737
pub v/b/canAdd bigInt/a bigInt/b
    bigIntCanAdd /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff `a - b` succeeds on `bigInt` (`true`).
: @dc l8589984738
pub v/b/canSub bigInt/a bigInt/b
    bigIntCanSub /a /b.

: Predicate returning true iff `a * b` succeeds on `bigInt` (`true`).
: @dc l8589984739
